hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"157","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abu Hurayrah (Allah amridhie) kwamba Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Atakayefunga mwezi wa Ramadhani kwa imani na kutarajia malipo, husamehewa madhambi yake yaliyotangulia))."
"158","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Abu Hurayrah (Allah amridhie) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Atakayefunga Ramadhani kwa imani na kutarajia malipo, husamehewa madhambi yake yaliyotangulia))."
